emit both light and a subtle scent reminiscent of sandalwood.  Shelves line
the walls and stand freely from wall to wall filled from top to bottom with
books and tomes of all shapes and sizes.  What little wall space that is not
filled by shelving is covered by tapestries woven of soft cloth.
