"bones"
"Bleach-white bones offer a frightening contrast to the peace of this calm
ocean grotto.  Gnaw marks are evident on all of the bones, where the flesh and
ligaments have been torn forcefully away from the bone.  It is unclear what
sort of creature the bones come from, but the size indicates that the creature
was much, much larger than an average human.
"
E
"chain"
"A thick, sturdy metal chain has been attached to a metal stake that has been
driven deep into the grotto wall to the north.  This chain is made of a
gleaming, silvery metal that shows no corrosion from the seawater around it. 
Whether this is because the chain is brand new or because the metal resists
corrosion is not clear.
"
