"A Large Circus Tent"
"You are in the interior of a large circus tent.  The fabric is shimmering
surgical gauze striped vertically in purple and green.  As you look around,
you see that the tent has three rings so multiple performances can go on at
once.  Overhead, a trapeze swings back and forth between two platforms.  To
your left a large animal cage holds five fierce looking white mice.  All in
all, the tent gives off a feeling of fun and well-being.

"
