desk.
"
E
"oak desk"
"This desk quite obviously clashes with the beautifully garish colors of the
rest of the tent.  Its smooth oak surface is inlaid with an intricate pewter
pattern of swirling mists.  Looking closer, you can see that the pewter mists
are moving as if pushed by a light breeze.  The desk itself is cluttered with
papers that seem to have no relevance to anything at all.
"
