bars appear to be made of solid gold, but upon closer examination, you can see
that they are sturdy steel covered with a mix of cheese and play-dough. 
Inside the cage, five fiersome looking white mice gnash their teeth at you. 
Although the bars are wide enough to let the mice roam free, these rabid
animosities seem quite content to stay where they are.
"
